Subject: AI-generated PRDs are great but missing edge cases

Hi PMAI team,

I've been using the AI PRD generation feature for 6 weeks and wanted to share detailed feedback.

What's working well:
- The executive summary section is consistently excellent
- User stories map well to our actual customer personas
- The format saves me about 2 hours per document

Where it falls short:
- Edge cases and error states are rarely included. For a health tech product this is critical — we need failure modes documented
- The AI doesn't ask about regulatory requirements (HIPAA, FDA) before generating
- Acceptance criteria tend to be too vague for our engineering team ("the system should handle...") rather than specific and testable

Would love to see a "document type" selector so healthcare/fintech teams can get more rigorous outputs.

Overall still a 9/10 product. Keep up the great work.

Tom Brennan
Director of Product
HealthTech Co
